{"path":"utility/variant/swap","title":"std::variant<Types...>::swap","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::variant&lt;Types...&gt;::</span>swap","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/variant/swap","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Swaps two variant objects.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> variant<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/* see below */</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(constexpr since C++20)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Swaps two <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant\"><code>variant</code></a> objects.\n</p>\n<ul><li> If both <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> are valueless by exception, does nothing.\n</li><li> Otherwise, if both <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> hold the same alternative, calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/get_if\"><span class=\"kw1096\">std::<span class=\"me2\">get_if</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>i<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>this<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">*</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/get_if\"><span class=\"kw1096\">std::<span class=\"me2\">get_if</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>i<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/addressof\"><span class=\"kw761\">std::<span class=\"me2\">addressof</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> where <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">i</span></code> is <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/index\"><code>index()</code></a>. If an exception is thrown, the state of the values depends on the exception safety of the <code>swap</code> function called.\n</li><li> Otherwise, exchanges values of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>. If an exception is thrown, the state of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> depends on exception safety of variant's move constructor.\n</li></ul>\n<p>The program is ill-formed unless type <code>T_i</code> are <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/Swappable\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">Swappable</em></a> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_move_constructible\"><span class=\"kw546\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_move_constructible_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T_i<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> for all <code>T_i</code> in <code>Types...</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <code>variant</code> object to swap with\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">this<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>index<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">index</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, may throw any exception thrown by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/get_if\"><span class=\"kw1096\">std::<span class=\"me2\">get_if</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>i<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>this<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">*</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/get_if\"><span class=\"kw1096\">std::<span class=\"me2\">get_if</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>i<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/addressof\"><span class=\"kw761\">std::<span class=\"me2\">addressof</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">i</span></code> being <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/index\"><code>index()</code></a>.\n</p><p>Otherwise, may throw any exception thrown by the move constructors of the alternatives currently held by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-full\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/language/noexcept_spec\"><code>noexcept</code></a> specification:&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-box\"><span class=\"t-cc\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_move_constructible\"><span class=\"kw550\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_move_constructible_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span><br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_swappable\"><span class=\"kw580\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_swappable_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Types<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> ...<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></span></div></div>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable ftm-begin ftm-has-value\">\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/feature_test\">Feature-test</a> macro\n</th>\n<th><abbr>Value</abbr>\n</th>\n<th><abbr>Std</abbr>\n</th>\n<th>Feature\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/feature_test#cpp_lib_variant\"><code>__cpp_lib_variant</code></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/compiler_support/20#cpp_lib_variant_202106L\"><code>202106L</code></a></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark\">(C++20)</span><br><span class=\"t-mark\">(DR)</span></td>\n<td>Fully <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span></span> <code>std::variant</code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;variant&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant\"><span class=\"kw1093\">std::<span class=\"me2\">variant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> v1<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, v2<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"abc\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/visit\"><span class=\"kw1094\">std::<span class=\"me2\">visit</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> x<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> x <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>, v1<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/visit\"><span class=\"kw1094\">std::<span class=\"me2\">visit</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> x<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> x <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>, v2<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    v1.<span class=\"me1\">swap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>v2<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/visit\"><span class=\"kw1094\">std::<span class=\"me2\">visit</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> x<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> x <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>, v1<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/visit\"><span class=\"kw1094\">std::<span class=\"me2\">visit</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> x<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> x <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>, v2<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>2 abc\nabc 2</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wg21.link/P2231R1\" data-external=\"1\">P2231R1</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++20\n</td>\n<td><code>swap</code> was not <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span></span> while non-trivial destructors can be <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span></span> in C++20\n</td>\n<td>made <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span></span>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/swap2\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>std::swap<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::variant)</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  specializes the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/swap\">std::swap</a></span> algorithm <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/variant","title":"std::variant"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::variant<Types...>::swap","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++17. Swaps two variant objects."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"rhs"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"If this->index() == rhs.index(), may throw any exception thrown by swap(*std::get_if<i>(this), *std::get_if<i>(std::addressof(rhs))) with i being index()."},{"label":"Notes"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"std::swap(std::variant)","note":"specializes the std::swap algorithm"}]}]},"standards":["C++17","C++20"],"wordCount":288,"codeBlockCount":2}
